WEBVTT

00:02.050 --> 00:03.430
Guys, hurry!

00:03.430 --> 00:06.390
We need to catch the train, 
or we won't get away!

00:06.390 --> 00:07.740
We're almost at the station!

00:07.740 --> 00:08.850
Right!

00:09.200 --> 00:11.130
Ewe, how's it looking?

00:11.130 --> 00:13.580
All clear. No one's around yet.

00:14.640 --> 00:16.010
What do I do?

00:16.010 --> 00:19.960
Everyone thinks it was the enemy's magic 
that turned the professor into a cat...

00:19.960 --> 00:22.460
Should I tell them the truth?

00:22.830 --> 00:26.010
It'll cause confusion if I tell 
them everything, though.

00:26.710 --> 00:29.550
I tried giving him some magic power 
when nobody was looking,

00:28.460 --> 00:31.670
HUFF

00:29.550 --> 00:31.670
but he didn't turn back.

00:31.970 --> 00:35.810
I guess I can't use Rebirth 
Magic twice in one day.

00:35.810 --> 00:39.510
I might need all my magic power to do it.

00:39.510 --> 00:42.430
I can still use my Plant Magic, though...

00:42.430 --> 00:43.990
Spica, are you all right?

00:43.990 --> 00:45.390
Oh, yeah.

00:45.660 --> 00:47.270
Chiron, are you okay?

00:47.270 --> 00:49.280
You look pale. Are you scared?

00:49.280 --> 00:50.760
Sh-Shut up!

00:50.760 --> 00:52.350
I'm just tired from all the running!

00:52.600 --> 00:54.310
Sorry I couldn't protect you earlier.

00:57.540 --> 01:01.330
My knees buckled when I saw the enemy.

01:05.310 --> 01:11.220
I promised I would serve the Aradia 
family and protect you to repay my debt.

01:12.540 --> 01:14.290
I won't fail you again.

01:15.030 --> 01:17.140
That thing freaked you out?

01:17.140 --> 01:20.100
Wow, sad. It didn't scare me one bit!

01:20.100 --> 01:22.010
You're teary-eyed, Chiron.

01:22.010 --> 01:23.390
Am not!

01:23.390 --> 01:25.260
My eyes just got dry!

01:25.260 --> 01:28.500
Are you one of the 
Aradia family's guards, Tarf?

01:28.500 --> 01:30.820
My job is to guard and serve Chiron.

01:30.820 --> 01:34.400
Are you sure he didn't turn out so 
spoiled because of your pampering?

01:31.020 --> 01:35.530
TOXIC

01:34.400 --> 01:35.530
I'm right here!

01:38.800 --> 01:40.270
I pamper him, huh?

01:40.270 --> 01:43.260
Professor Claude said something 
like that to me, too.

01:43.260 --> 01:44.750
He did?

01:46.300 --> 01:47.650
F-rank...

01:48.630 --> 01:51.170
You spend too much energy on Chiron.

01:51.170 --> 01:53.120
Focus on yourself.

01:53.120 --> 01:54.580
I apologize.

01:54.840 --> 02:00.000
If you truly care about Chiron, 
it's important to have faith in him, too.

02:00.630 --> 02:01.680
So he said.

02:01.680 --> 02:04.110
The professor said that?

02:07.030 --> 02:09.780
Faith, huh?

03:43.450 --> 03:44.900
Look, the station!

03:45.180 --> 03:47.730
All right! We've almost outrun them!

03:53.960 --> 03:57.410
Boy oh boy, we sure got blown away.

04:00.130 --> 04:03.850
I knew Claude wouldn't disappoint.

04:03.850 --> 04:05.590
Is this really the time?

04:05.590 --> 04:07.880
They're going to take 
the train out of here.

04:07.880 --> 04:08.800
Well, well...

04:08.800 --> 04:13.600
You would have been blown up if I hadn't
saved you with my Shadow Snake.

04:13.600 --> 04:15.290
What do you say?

04:16.380 --> 04:17.520
Thanks.

04:17.520 --> 04:19.370
Very good.

04:19.370 --> 04:23.160
Anyway, there's no way 
they can escape by train.

04:23.730 --> 04:29.020
I took care of it while you were 
busy trying to catch Spica.

04:29.020 --> 04:30.400
No way...

04:30.400 --> 04:31.430
Oh, no...

04:32.150 --> 04:33.540
They got us.

04:34.260 --> 04:36.370
The tunnel's been caved in!

04:38.060 --> 04:42.020
There's no escape for them, 
and no help coming.

04:42.020 --> 04:45.530
Now, time for the manhunt.

04:46.140 --> 04:48.920
Shit! The train's gone, 
and there are no carriages!

04:48.920 --> 04:50.450
There's no way out!

04:50.450 --> 04:52.670
Should we run to the foot of the mountain?

04:52.670 --> 04:53.840
That'll be difficult.

04:54.210 --> 04:55.800
Night's coming.

04:55.800 --> 04:59.320
It'll be challenging to 
flee from them in the dark.

04:59.320 --> 05:00.930
I-I know!

05:00.930 --> 05:04.650
What if I use my Sagittarius 
magic to fly back to town?

05:04.650 --> 05:06.810
You can take all six of us out of here?

05:06.810 --> 05:09.370
Er, no way. Just me. Maybe one more.

05:09.370 --> 05:11.050
Then fly home by yourself!

05:11.050 --> 05:12.940
Wait, wait! Hear me out!

05:12.940 --> 05:15.970
I'll go back and call for help.

05:15.970 --> 05:17.210
That might work.

05:18.140 --> 05:20.750
I can't fly for more than 
ten minutes, though.

05:20.750 --> 05:22.340
I won't get past the mountain.

05:22.340 --> 05:24.230
You're useless.

05:24.230 --> 05:26.470
Hey! Stop looking at me like that!

05:28.010 --> 05:31.390
Come on. I'm trying to help.

05:31.870 --> 05:33.050
Chiron...

05:33.950 --> 05:37.950
Maybe we just have to fight.

05:40.410 --> 05:43.890
In any case, we need to lay 
low and come up with a plan.

05:48.490 --> 05:50.740
I see you.

05:50.740 --> 05:51.630
Run!

05:51.630 --> 05:52.600
Where to?

05:53.690 --> 05:54.920
Capella!

05:55.520 --> 05:58.870
Aries Magic: Flame Burst!

06:04.170 --> 06:06.820
I-It's draining my strength!

06:08.940 --> 06:10.750
Ewe! Are you okay?

06:11.350 --> 06:15.050
The Aries girl has potential.

06:15.410 --> 06:18.940
Not that she's any match for us.

06:18.940 --> 06:21.320
Sacrificing herself to 
protect her friend...

06:21.320 --> 06:23.340
What a beautiful bond.

06:23.340 --> 06:26.120
Claude isn't here, though.

06:26.120 --> 06:28.630
He's there. That black cat.

06:28.630 --> 06:30.060
So cute.

06:31.200 --> 06:33.230
Just as the boss said.

06:33.230 --> 06:35.030
We have to fight, even if we can't win!

06:35.030 --> 06:36.500
Cancer Magic...

06:38.310 --> 06:40.310
Fulad al-Haram!

06:41.020 --> 06:43.750
I was waiting for you 
two to stand together.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.890
Now you're both stuck.

06:47.310 --> 06:48.540
Wow!

06:48.540 --> 06:49.900
You trapped the enemy!

06:49.900 --> 06:51.300
Good going, Tarf!

06:52.930 --> 06:54.270
Thank goodness.

06:54.270 --> 06:56.180
I managed to protect everyone this time.

06:56.180 --> 06:58.750
But maybe he can use his 
shadow magic to escape.

06:59.350 --> 07:04.280
This is just a hypothesis, but I think
he can't move to a shadow he can't see.

07:04.280 --> 07:07.310
Which means he can't get out of here.

07:07.310 --> 07:09.430
But the enemy's strong.

07:09.820 --> 07:12.370
I don't know how long my magic will last.

07:14.580 --> 07:16.190
Marvelous!

07:16.190 --> 07:19.290
The magic power it takes to 
create so much steel so quickly!

07:19.290 --> 07:20.030
The strength!

07:20.400 --> 07:22.990
Claude's is a coven of elites!

07:22.990 --> 07:24.410
This sucks.

07:24.410 --> 07:26.010
It's pitch black in here.

07:26.570 --> 07:27.880
Relax.

07:27.880 --> 07:29.940
I'll get us out in a jiffy.

07:31.800 --> 07:35.480
We have to come up with 
a plan for fighting them.

07:35.480 --> 07:38.940
To be honest, we can't fight them 
head-on. They'll just take us all out.

07:39.210 --> 07:43.720
Our only hope of defeating them is 
for our professor to be restored.

07:43.720 --> 07:47.610
I can make him human once my 
magic power's fully replenished.

07:47.610 --> 07:49.650
But we don't have time to wait.

07:50.650 --> 07:51.740
Think...

07:52.600 --> 07:53.370
How...

07:53.750 --> 07:55.750
How do we do this?

08:01.030 --> 08:02.250
Of course!

08:02.250 --> 08:03.420
We need to get there!

08:03.740 --> 08:05.260
Do you have an idea?

08:05.260 --> 08:06.570
I'm not certain, but...

08:06.570 --> 08:07.720
Just tell us!

08:08.040 --> 08:09.800
I might be able to restore the professor

08:09.800 --> 08:12.970
if we can get to the Selene spring 
to restore my magic power.

08:12.970 --> 08:16.550
Can you undo the cat transformation 
if you have full magic power?

08:17.850 --> 08:20.620
We don't have time for me to explain,

08:20.620 --> 08:24.140
but I know how to turn 
the professor back.

08:24.610 --> 08:29.110
Basically, we need to get you 
and the professor to the spring.

08:29.440 --> 08:32.700
But the spring's way up the mountain.

08:32.700 --> 08:34.850
It'll take at least half 
an hour of running.

08:33.090 --> 08:35.840
30 MINUTES

08:35.250 --> 08:38.450
They might break out in that time.

08:38.450 --> 08:39.320
What if...

08:39.320 --> 08:42.790
What if I fly there with 
Spica and the prof?

08:42.790 --> 08:45.260
It shouldn't take more than 
ten minutes if we fly.

08:46.610 --> 08:48.630
Why do you keep looking at me like that?

08:48.630 --> 08:50.200
Do you not trust me to do it?

08:50.200 --> 08:52.460
It's Spica they're after.

08:52.960 --> 08:55.780
Once they're out, they're 
going to come after you.

08:56.220 --> 08:59.300
Can you really protect Spica 
on your way to the spring?

08:59.300 --> 09:01.570
Y-You don't need to tell me that.

09:02.350 --> 09:04.510
I'm scared, sure.

09:04.510 --> 09:06.130
I'm about to piss myself.

09:06.960 --> 09:10.780
I can't promise we'll make it, either.

09:11.350 --> 09:12.160
But...

09:13.170 --> 09:18.420
I don't want to be a useless 
sitting duck anymore.

09:20.610 --> 09:22.560
Let's go with that plan!

09:22.560 --> 09:23.740
Don't worry.

09:23.740 --> 09:25.740
I'm confident you'll pull it off.

09:26.630 --> 09:27.990
Tarf...

09:28.530 --> 09:30.520
Why are you so surprised?

09:30.520 --> 09:33.090
Er, I just thought you'd 
be the first one to say no.

09:33.480 --> 09:36.590
It's true that my job is to protect you.

09:37.130 --> 09:41.760
But as terrified as you are, you always 
make an effort to move forward.

09:42.300 --> 09:46.690
And just now, you were 
thinking of ways to save us.

09:46.690 --> 09:49.920
So I've decided to have faith in you.

09:51.130 --> 09:55.060
Change our fortunes and 
guide us to victory!

09:57.320 --> 10:01.710
Sorry for questioning you. 
I wanted to be sure you were prepared.

10:02.040 --> 10:04.660
Abandon Spica, and I'll kill you.

10:09.130 --> 10:10.460
Don't worry.

10:10.460 --> 10:12.640
I can look after myself.

10:12.640 --> 10:14.120
Let's do this together.

10:17.180 --> 10:18.280
Stay safe.

10:18.280 --> 10:19.310
You, too.

10:19.310 --> 10:21.290
Run away as soon as you're in danger.

10:21.290 --> 10:22.630
All right. Let's go!

10:27.440 --> 10:29.460
We're counting on you, Chiron.

10:31.220 --> 10:34.990
The rest of us will keep the enemy 
locked in until the professor returns.

10:47.820 --> 10:48.870
Here they come!

10:48.870 --> 10:50.450
Capricorn Magic!

10:51.910 --> 10:52.880
Now!

10:52.880 --> 10:53.900
Fix the hole!

10:53.900 --> 10:54.910
Cancer Magic!

10:56.430 --> 10:57.450
Done.

10:57.450 --> 10:59.620
Your plan's working out so far, Capella.

11:00.760 --> 11:05.630
We stop them from all three sides as 
soon as they tear through the walls,

11:05.630 --> 11:07.950
and Tarf quickly fixes the hole.

11:07.950 --> 11:11.480
This tactic ought to buy us enough time.

11:11.480 --> 11:15.650
Looks like they can't keep 
using Grand Magic, either.

11:15.650 --> 11:18.070
We just need to keep this up.

11:20.360 --> 11:21.240
Look out!

11:21.530 --> 11:24.030
The enemy can control real snakes, too!

11:24.030 --> 11:25.650
When did they get here?

11:29.070 --> 11:30.770
I got distracted!

11:30.770 --> 11:31.820
Shit!

11:31.820 --> 11:33.430
They're gonna get out!

11:34.360 --> 11:36.350
Hello!

11:40.880 --> 11:43.120
I hope they're all right.

11:43.120 --> 11:46.060
Whatever happens, they'll figure it out.

11:46.060 --> 11:48.530
Damn it... Where is the spring?

11:48.530 --> 11:50.560
We've been flying for nearly ten minutes.

11:51.240 --> 11:53.470
His hand's trembling.

11:53.470 --> 11:55.090
What are you looking at?

11:55.090 --> 11:57.130
Is it my sweaty hands?

11:57.130 --> 11:59.270
I wasn't thinking about your sweaty hands!

11:59.270 --> 12:02.560
How are you so calm about this?

12:02.890 --> 12:08.540
I thought you were a wussy, 
talentless loser like me!

12:09.110 --> 12:11.550
That's what he thought of me?

12:11.990 --> 12:13.980
I'm not calm.

12:13.980 --> 12:16.490
I'm about to cry at any minute.

12:16.490 --> 12:19.460
But I have to stay strong 
so we can all make it back.

12:21.450 --> 12:27.270
Anyway, given how stuck-up you are,
I didn't think you knew you were a wuss.

12:27.270 --> 12:28.550
You're pretty sensitive, huh?

12:28.550 --> 12:30.430
Don't tell anyone else!

12:30.430 --> 12:33.010
I'm the second prince of Aradia.

12:33.010 --> 12:34.930
I can't let anyone see 
me being vulnerable.

12:34.930 --> 12:37.130
I'm pretty sure we all saw.

12:37.130 --> 12:40.760
My brother would have 
gotten out of this easily.

12:41.830 --> 12:44.590
Your brother? The first prince?

12:44.590 --> 12:45.630
Yeah.

12:45.630 --> 12:47.850
He's strong and talented.

12:47.850 --> 12:50.460
He's a hero loved by the people.

12:50.460 --> 12:51.930
Nothing like me.

12:51.930 --> 12:55.100
Er, well, you're good 
in your own way, too.

12:55.100 --> 12:57.160
Don't bother trying to 
make me feel better!

12:57.630 --> 13:00.590
I wasn't born with much magic power.

13:00.590 --> 13:04.170
I only really got into Diana 
because of my connections.

13:04.170 --> 13:06.140
He's spiraling...

13:06.510 --> 13:09.540
I tried working on other 
stuff that wasn't magic, too.

13:09.540 --> 13:15.170
People here look down on you if 
you're royalty and can't use magic.

13:15.500 --> 13:17.070
I get it.

13:17.070 --> 13:20.140
Knowing you don't have talent sucks.

13:20.430 --> 13:24.190
You compare yourself to other people 
and feel terrible about yourself.

13:25.940 --> 13:29.070
Why did I tell you about this?!

13:29.070 --> 13:31.240
Forget everything I said! Got it?!

13:31.240 --> 13:34.530
And here I was, hearing him out!

13:35.030 --> 13:37.000
Look over there! The spring!

13:37.270 --> 13:39.190
We can bring Claude back now, right?

13:39.190 --> 13:40.210
Yeah!

13:40.210 --> 13:41.670
Well, well.

13:41.990 --> 13:45.160
I was wondering why you two snuck off.

13:45.160 --> 13:47.380
You're trying to revive Claude.

13:47.380 --> 13:48.550
No...

13:48.550 --> 13:49.840
Why is she here?

13:51.290 --> 13:55.210
The snakies watched you fly away.

13:55.650 --> 13:57.270
They're so smart, aren't they?

13:57.570 --> 13:59.620
What have you done with the others?

14:00.660 --> 14:03.180
They held on for a while,

14:03.180 --> 14:05.660
but Rigel's probably shredding 
them with his magic about now.

14:08.810 --> 14:10.120
No!

14:10.460 --> 14:13.600
Not that you two are getting away, either.

14:20.000 --> 14:23.020
Ow... Chiron, are you all right?

14:24.710 --> 14:26.680
Is it true?

14:26.680 --> 14:28.480
Are they all...

14:28.480 --> 14:30.050
There's no way.

14:30.750 --> 14:32.610
I won't believe it.

14:32.610 --> 14:34.730
Tarf would never die.

14:34.730 --> 14:36.860
He's my guard!

14:37.610 --> 14:39.230
You're right.

14:39.700 --> 14:43.440
There's no point in worrying 
about them right now.

14:43.440 --> 14:47.090
All we can do right now is
restore the professor quickly.

14:47.090 --> 14:48.370
Let's get to the spring.

14:48.370 --> 14:49.180
Right.

14:51.360 --> 14:52.490
Chiron!

14:53.100 --> 14:56.580
I told you, you aren't getting away.

14:57.620 --> 15:00.530
Look at you, trembling 
like a puppy. How cute.

15:00.840 --> 15:02.930
Say "arf, arf"!

15:02.930 --> 15:04.510
With your tongue out!

15:05.500 --> 15:07.540
Get away from Chiron!

15:08.780 --> 15:10.000
Piss off.

15:11.090 --> 15:13.480
Her magic absorbs life force.

15:13.480 --> 15:15.190
I'm a bad match for her.

15:16.480 --> 15:18.860
Ow! I'm still bleeding!

15:18.860 --> 15:20.970
It's hopeless. She's out of our league.

15:20.970 --> 15:22.360
We don't stand a chance.

15:26.600 --> 15:27.800
Spica!

15:28.480 --> 15:32.190
I'm curious to see how long 
your Rebirth Magic lasts.

15:32.190 --> 15:34.940
M-My body won't move!

15:35.710 --> 15:36.880
Someone...

15:36.880 --> 15:38.660
Someone help!

15:41.130 --> 15:43.120
Ch-Chiron...

15:43.760 --> 15:45.750
Run.

15:46.360 --> 15:47.580
Run!

15:50.040 --> 15:51.850
What's wrong with her?

15:51.850 --> 15:54.070
She's more worried about me than herself.

15:55.060 --> 15:58.760
Yet here I am, still trying 
to depend on other people.

16:00.070 --> 16:01.940
What do I mean, "someone"?

16:02.370 --> 16:03.770
It's me.

16:03.770 --> 16:05.480
I have to do it!

16:05.750 --> 16:06.940
Just die.

16:07.320 --> 16:10.900
I might as well die if I'm 
going to be so cowardly!

16:11.290 --> 16:14.060
I'm confident you'll pull it off.

16:15.070 --> 16:19.180
My friends are counting on me!

16:19.610 --> 16:21.590
Sagittarius Magic!

16:23.000 --> 16:26.910
You aren't blowing me away 
with that kind of wind.

16:26.910 --> 16:29.640
Or, what, are you trying to lift my skirt?

16:32.100 --> 16:33.590
Wind Blow!

16:34.330 --> 16:37.860
He used the wind he made to 
launch the stick like a spear.

16:37.860 --> 16:40.050
He was trying to protect 
Spica from the start.

16:42.110 --> 16:43.900
Chiron...

16:43.900 --> 16:46.030
I never knew you had so much talent.

16:47.070 --> 16:51.350
I don't have much magic, so I've always 
had to make up for it with other skills.

16:53.120 --> 16:55.020
I'm not a puppy!

16:55.020 --> 16:58.650
I'm the second prince of 
Aradia, Chiron Sagittarius!

16:58.650 --> 17:00.520
You'd better watch it, goth loli lady!

17:01.650 --> 17:03.490
Thanks for the help.

17:03.490 --> 17:04.550
Yeah.

17:04.550 --> 17:06.690
Don't ever forget that you owe me.

17:06.690 --> 17:08.720
But what do we do now?

17:08.720 --> 17:11.270
The Selene spring is right there.

17:11.270 --> 17:15.160
We just need to get there, and we can 
restore the professor to human form.

17:15.160 --> 17:19.890
You make it sound easy, but we're 
going to have to get past her.

17:19.890 --> 17:23.140
Damn it. I'm being pushed 
back by these weaklings.

17:23.700 --> 17:27.740
Why am I having such a hard 
time abducting one girl?

17:27.740 --> 17:29.600
No... No...

17:30.280 --> 17:32.630
I can't fail!

17:33.700 --> 17:37.990
I need to be perfect!

17:39.800 --> 17:44.230
Ophiuchus Magic: Envy Hellfire!

17:44.230 --> 17:45.700
Black flames!

17:45.700 --> 17:48.000
She can use Fire Magic, too?

17:52.300 --> 17:53.880
It bent like a snake!

17:53.880 --> 17:54.830
Anima!

17:56.250 --> 17:57.550
Are you okay?

17:57.550 --> 17:58.500
It hurts!

17:58.500 --> 18:00.340
No, it doesn't.

18:01.170 --> 18:03.810
But what is this chill?

18:06.240 --> 18:09.560
This flame is stealing my life force!

18:09.560 --> 18:10.690
Take it off!

18:11.660 --> 18:15.060
The flames are imbued with 
the black snake's power.

18:15.060 --> 18:18.250
How is that even fair?!

18:19.000 --> 18:20.900
The fire's spreading.

18:21.200 --> 18:22.150
Oh, no!

18:22.150 --> 18:25.630
We have to get the professor back 
before it spreads to the spring!

18:25.630 --> 18:27.020
Hey, wait, Spica!

18:27.020 --> 18:28.080
Where are you going?

18:33.270 --> 18:34.700
No way...

18:34.700 --> 18:37.710
She can fly using fire like Ewe can.

18:37.710 --> 18:40.270
Her magic's too powerful. 
We can't even fight back.

18:40.270 --> 18:41.630
What do we do?

18:42.170 --> 18:45.560
How do we get out of this?

18:45.980 --> 18:48.560
Get it now? I'm a lot stronger.

18:48.560 --> 18:52.660
Stop resisting and come with me.

18:52.660 --> 18:56.350
Do that, and I'll spare that prince there.

18:56.350 --> 18:57.230
But...

18:58.660 --> 19:00.290
Not him.

19:03.440 --> 19:04.890
That was when she took him!

19:04.890 --> 19:07.610
I'll kill Claude with my own hands.

19:07.610 --> 19:08.710
Give him back!

19:08.710 --> 19:09.820
Nope.

19:09.820 --> 19:13.040
You were part of Claude 
Coven before, weren't you?

19:13.040 --> 19:14.890
Why are you treating him like this?

19:14.890 --> 19:16.370
Why?

19:16.370 --> 19:18.500
Fine. I'll tell you.

19:18.750 --> 19:22.030
This man tried to use me.

19:22.030 --> 19:24.470
He tried to use my Rebirth Magic.

19:24.470 --> 19:25.720
Huh?

19:25.720 --> 19:28.090
You don't know anything, do you?

19:28.090 --> 19:34.190
You weren't born with your Rebirth 
Magic. You acquired it later.

19:35.410 --> 19:37.640
Poor you, Spica.

19:38.020 --> 19:41.620
Claude seems to have taken 
quite a liking to you,

19:41.620 --> 19:44.260
but try not to get the wrong idea.

19:44.260 --> 19:47.300
He only wants your Rebirth Magic.

19:47.990 --> 19:52.240
This asshole is a con man. 
He swindles you with his smile.

19:52.540 --> 19:55.130
He's just using you.

19:55.130 --> 19:57.740
Using me?

20:00.750 --> 20:01.750
Spica!

20:02.260 --> 20:04.630
Don't listen to the enemy!

20:04.630 --> 20:07.120
I don't know what she's talking about,

20:07.120 --> 20:10.920
but the professor risked 
his life to protect us!

20:10.920 --> 20:13.670
Nothing can change that!

20:17.100 --> 20:19.650
You don't need to tell me that.

20:20.160 --> 20:21.180
Arc...

20:22.310 --> 20:25.150
Let me tell you something, too.

20:25.840 --> 20:30.350
I know the professor is using 
me for my Rebirth Magic.

20:31.080 --> 20:35.550
And I'm using the professor to 
become a first-class magician.

20:36.160 --> 20:38.920
That's how our relationship is.

20:38.920 --> 20:41.700
I don't know what happened 
between you two.

20:41.700 --> 20:43.420
But I...

20:43.790 --> 20:45.560
I'll protect you this time.

20:45.560 --> 20:46.470
All of you.

20:46.850 --> 20:50.640
I decided I'd trust the 
professor no matter what!

20:50.640 --> 20:51.890
Anima!

20:53.980 --> 20:56.660
Trust him? You dumb girl!

20:56.660 --> 20:59.180
Your magic won't work on me!

21:00.360 --> 21:01.600
What is she...

21:02.610 --> 21:06.070
The professor always helped me.

21:06.070 --> 21:09.500
It's my turn to help him!

21:10.530 --> 21:11.860
Enough!

21:11.860 --> 21:12.820
Spica!

21:13.120 --> 21:15.790
You idiot! What did you 
think you were doing?

21:15.790 --> 21:17.570
Chiron!

21:17.570 --> 21:18.790
Do me a favor.

21:19.080 --> 21:20.970
We need to defeat her!

21:22.750 --> 21:25.090
Defeat me?

21:25.090 --> 21:26.680
Just try!

21:27.140 --> 21:30.060
Envy Hellfire Cobra!

21:33.360 --> 21:35.350
You won't survive this time.

21:43.090 --> 21:45.520
Here we go, Chiron.

21:46.110 --> 21:49.740
Wind Cross Magic!

21:46.110 --> 21:49.740
Plant Cross Magic!

21:50.240 --> 21:51.670
Arc...

21:51.670 --> 21:53.360
You're going down!

23:25.600 --> 23:26.580
Arc...

23:26.580 --> 23:28.870
We're taking you down with our magic!

23:28.870 --> 23:31.470
Everything hinges on this magic!

23:31.470 --> 23:33.890
Next episode: "The Superior Magician."

23:33.890 --> 23:36.440
Spica is mine.

23:36.440 --> 23:39.280
I can't wait to see Claude's face.

23:36.470 --> 23:40.000
EPISODE 12
THE SUPERIOR MAGICIAN
